{"file":"stackhawk-hawkscan-2.6.2-v3.zip","bytes":102722,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"hawkscan","description":"Configure, run, and interpret HawkScan DAST results inside Claude Code. Generates stackhawk.yml configs, runs scans via CLI or Docker, and transforms security findings into prioritized fix tasks for your coding agent.","version":"2.6.2","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/stackhawk/agent-skills","homepage":"https://docs.stackhawk.com","keywords":["security","dast","appsec","hawkscan","stackhawk","api-security","vulnerability-scanning"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"hawkscan","description":"Configure, run, and interpret HawkScan DAST results. Generates stackhawk.yml configs, runs scans via CLI or Docker, and transforms security findings into prioritized fix tasks for your coding agent.","version":"2.6.2","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/stackhawk/agent-skills","homepage":"https://docs.stackhawk.com","keywords":["security","dast","appsec","hawkscan","stackhawk","api-security","vulnerability-scanning"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/hawkscan/SKILL.md","name":"hawkscan","description":"Runs the HawkScan DAST security loop — configure, scan, fix all reported vulnerabilities (not just your changes), rescan to verify. Performs code-first discovery to configure high-value scans, and quality-gates every scan against code-derived expectations before findings are parsed. Use when the user asks to run or perform a security/DAST scan, to test an app or API for vulnerabilities, or to verify a vulnerability is fixed; and AUTONOMOUSLY right after you complete a code change (feature, bugfix, refactor) — \"done\" means \"done and secure,\" so run the loop without asking permission. Do NOT trigger for: informational questions about what HawkScan is, detects, or how it works (e.g. \"what vulnerabilities does HawkScan find?\"); editing stackhawk.yml or other config without running a scan; querying existing findings, security posture, untriaged counts, or scan history (use the stackhawk-api skill); documentation-only changes; installing or setting up the CLI; or when the user explicitly says to skip scanning.","headings":["HawkScan Skill","Prerequisites (preflight — run before anything else)","Companion Skills","StackHawk Platform Model (read this first)","Progress output","Phase 0: App Setup & Verification","Step 1: Assess Context","Step 1a: Discover What to Scan","Step 1c: Environment Checks (run in order)","Step 2a: Generate `stackhawk.yml` from Scratch","Phase 1c: Authentication Configuration","Phase 1c.5: Auth Analyzer Fallback","Phase 1c.6: Seed Backend Data (empty datastore)","Step 2b: Tune Existing `stackhawk.yml`","Step 3: Validate and Run","CLI Reference","Exit Codes","Step 4.5: Quality Gate"],"name_hint":"hawkscan","description_zh":"执行 HawkScan DAST 配置、扫描、修复全部报告漏洞及复扫循环，先从代码发现重点并按代码预期验证扫描质量。原说明要求代码变更后自动运行；资料问答、只改配置、文档、安装和明确跳过不触发，已有平台发现查询使用 api。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["HawkScan Skill for Claude","What This Does","Prerequisites","Installation","Add the StackHawk marketplace","Install the HawkScan skill","Usage","Supported Configurations","Security Note","Resources","License"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/icon.svg",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".codex-plugin/plugin.json","README.md","hooks/cursor/hooks.json","hooks/cursor/stop.sh","hooks/hooks.json","hooks/post-commit-scan","hooks/run-hook.cmd","hooks/session-start","hooks/skill-activated","hooks/stop","skills/hawkscan/SKILL.md","skills/hawkscan/references/agent-detection.md","skills/hawkscan/references/app-discovery.md","skills/hawkscan/references/auth-analyzer-fallback.md","skills/hawkscan/references/auth-config.md","skills/hawkscan/references/autonomous-loop.md","skills/hawkscan/references/cli-reference.md","skills/hawkscan/references/config-patterns.md","skills/hawkscan/references/docker-usage.md","skills/hawkscan/references/fals